                                                                                
 Usage: opentide generate [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...                           
                                                                                
 Generate schemas, templates, docs and exports                                  
                                                                                
 Run with no argument for the full pipeline, or name one or more phases to run  
 only those, in the order given: schemas, templates, vocabs, snippets.          
                                                                                
 Regenerate editor schemas without paying for documentation: `opentide generate 
 schemas templates vocabs snippets`.                                            
                                                                                
